      "text": "4- reading → drafting: Fixed, pre-written system prompt (not model-\ngenerated) sets the task. Email content passed separately as data, never\nmerged into that prompt. Model drafts a reply; recipient is pinned to\nthe original sender, not model-chosen.",
      "fontSize": 18.69816572773072,
