      "seed": 841795786,
      "version": 1055,
      "versionNonce": 789231204,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785669725923,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "> No match escalates to a structured-output LLM call — returns\nclean/injection/ambiguous directly, not yes/no. \"Ambiguous\" is now\na real final answer (see ClassifierResult).",
      "fontSize": 18.91138054862602,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "> No match escalates to a structured-output LLM call — returns clean/injection/ambiguous directly, not yes/no. \"Ambiguous\" is now a real final answer (see ClassifierResult).",
