      "text": "Phase 2- Step 2: Tools",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Phase 2- Step 2: Tools",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 1662907161,
      "index": "b0T",
      "isDeleted": false,
      "seed": 1,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "step2ToolsBodyTextA1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 910.7696126177957,
      "y": 1427.2407676034973,
      "width": 1195.9998168945312,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784881765866,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "> DONE — auth_tool_access: gated by HumanInTheLoopMiddleware (interrupt_on),\n     Command + ToolRuntime writes state.authenticated.\n> DONE — fetch_inbox: reads data/inbox/*.md, Command + ToolRuntime writes\n     state.inbox. No middleware — not sensitive, no human gate needed.\n> DONE — send_email: recipient pulled from current_email (never the model),\n     draft body from state. No middleware — single interrupt() already\n     happened at draft-review, one gate only since sending is irreversible.\n> HITL: single interrupt() at draft-review (reviews state, not tool-call\n     args) — not HumanInTheLoopMiddleware. No second gate on send.\n> Schema: added RejectionRecord (message_id + reason) so rejection_reasons\n     never needs resetting — filter by message_id instead.\n> DONE — registry.py: TOOL_PERMISSIONS dict keyed by all 6 FSM state names\n     (not State fields), every state present so lookup never needs a default.\n> DONE — guardrails/injection.py: regex fast-path returns \"injection\"\n     immediately; no match escalates to model.with_structured_output(\n     ClassifierResult). ClassifierResult simplified to one field\n     (injection_type: Literal[clean/injection/ambiguous]), replacing the\n     original is_injection: bool from the Phase 1 threat-model lock.\n> Still open: guardrails/pii.py, and the graph itself (build.py/nodes.py).",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "> DONE — auth_tool_access: gated by HumanInTheLoopMiddleware (interrupt_on), Command + ToolRuntime writes state.authenticated. > DONE — fetch_inbox: reads data/inbox/*.md, Command + ToolRuntime writes state.inbox. No middleware — not sensitive, no human gate needed. > DONE — send_email: recipient pulled from current_email (never the model), draft body from state. No middleware — single interrupt() already happened at draft-review, one gate only since sending is irreversible. > HITL: single interrupt() at draft-review (reviews state, not tool-call args) — not HumanInTheLoopMiddleware. No second gate on send. > Schema: added RejectionRecord (message_id + reason) so rejection_reasons never needs resetting — filter by message_id instead. > DONE — registry.py: TOOL_PERMISSIONS dict keyed by all 6 FSM state names (not State fields), every state present so lookup never needs a default. > DONE — guardrails/injection.py: regex fast-path returns \"injection\" immediately; no match escalates to model.with_structured_output(ClassifierResult). ClassifierResult simplified to one field (injection_type: Literal[clean/injection/ambiguous]), replacing the original is_injection: bool from the Phase 1 threat-model lock. > Still open: guardrails/pii.py, and the graph itself (build.py/nodes.py).",
      "height": 720,
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "version": 380,
      "versionNonce": 126047799,
      "index": "b0U",
      "isDeleted": false,
      "seed": 1,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "step3GuardrailsBoxRectA1",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": -55.403644680664,
      "y": 2507.6559189105337,
      "width": 1250,
      "height": 585,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
