      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1786870538751,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "> DONE — registry.py: TOOL_PERMISSIONS dict, keyed by all 6 FSM states —\n     unauthenticated: [auth_tool_access], reading: [fetch_inbox],\n     drafting/awaiting_approval/sending/done: [].\n> DONE — guardrails/injection.py: get_injection_type(email) -> str, two-tier —\n     regex fast-path trusted immediately on match, returns \"injection\";\n     no match escalates to model.with_structured_output(ClassifierResult)\n     for clean/injection/ambiguous. Never exposed as a tool (no .bind_tools()).\n> DONE — guardrails/pii.py: redact_pii(logger, method_name, event_dict), a\n     structlog processor (opt-out, wired before JSONRenderer()). Regex-scans\n     log values by content for email addresses, replaces each match with its\n     HMAC-SHA256 pseudonym (keyed by PII_HMAC_SECRET). Only touches the\n     logged copy, never State.",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "> DONE — registry.py: TOOL_PERMISSIONS dict, keyed by all 6 FSM states — unauthenticated: [auth_tool_access], reading: [fetch_inbox], drafting/awaiting_approval/sending/done: []. > DONE — guardrails/injection.py: get_injection_type(email) -> str, two-tier — regex fast-path trusted immediately on match, returns \"injection\"; no match escalates to model.with_structured_output(ClassifierResult) for clean/injection/ambiguous. Never exposed as a tool (no .bind_tools()). > DONE — guardrails/pii.py: redact_pii(logger, method_name, event_dict), a structlog processor (opt-out, wired before JSONRenderer()). Regex-scans log values by content for email addresses, replaces each match with its HMAC-SHA256 pseudonym (keyed by PII_HMAC_SECRET). Only touches the logged copy, never State.",
      "height": 460,
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
