    {
      "id": "step4NodesBodyTextA1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -41.403644680664,
      "y": 3263.2359189105337,
      "width": 1196,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1786870538751,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "> DONE — unauthenticated(state): reads messages; LLM call w/\n     auth_tool_access bound; returns messages.\n> DONE — reading(state): reads messages; LLM call w/ fetch_inbox\n     bound; returns messages.\n> DONE — guard(state): reads inbox; pops next email, classifies via\n     get_injection_type. clean -> returns current_email. flagged\n     (injection/ambiguous) -> narrow SmallFlaggedEmail schema for the\n     model-generated reason, then builds full FlaggedEmail -> returns\n     flagged_emails.\n> IN PROGRESS — drafting(state): reads current_email +\n     rejection_reasons (filtered by message_id, redraft vs.\n     first-draft detection). Will use narrow SmallDraft schema\n     (subject+body only — recipient derived from current_email.sender,\n     never asked of the model), then construct full Draft; returns\n     draft only. Signature/design fully locked, SmallDraft added to\n     state.py — but the node body itself is still a stale placeholder\n     stub in code, not yet the real implementation.\n> NOT STARTED — awaiting_approval, sending.",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "> DONE — unauthenticated(state): reads messages; LLM call w/ auth_tool_access bound; returns messages. > DONE — reading(state): reads messages; LLM call w/ fetch_inbox bound; returns messages. > DONE — guard(state): reads inbox; pops next email, classifies via get_injection_type. clean -> returns current_email. flagged (injection/ambiguous) -> narrow SmallFlaggedEmail schema for the model-generated reason, then builds full FlaggedEmail -> returns flagged_emails. > IN PROGRESS — drafting(state): reads current_email + rejection_reasons (filtered by message_id, redraft vs. first-draft detection). Will use narrow SmallDraft schema (subject+body only — recipient derived from current_email.sender, never asked of the model), then construct full Draft; returns draft only. Signature/design fully locked, SmallDraft added to state.py — but the node body itself is still a stale placeholder stub in code, not yet the real implementation. > NOT STARTED — awaiting_approval, sending.",
      "height": 690,
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 100000006,
      "index": "b0Za",
      "isDeleted": false,
      "seed": 1,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
