      "isDeleted": false,
      "seed": 1232106660,
      "text": "blue = LLM node    orange = ToolNode (executes tool, injects ToolRuntime)\ngreen = deterministic node    violet = HITL interrupt()    grey = START / END\nsolid = conditional edge (router fn)    dashed = fixed edge / Command(goto)",
      "originalText": "blue = LLM node    orange = ToolNode (executes tool, injects ToolRuntime)\ngreen = deterministic node    violet = HITL interrupt()    grey = START / END\nsolid = conditional edge (router fn)    dashed = fixed edge / Command(goto)",
