      "seed": 108649775,
      "text": "from              | reads                    | condition                        | to                          | decided by\n------------------+--------------------------+----------------------------------+-----------------------------+----------------------------\nSTART             | authenticated            | False / True                     | unauthenticated / reading   | route_entry\nunauthenticated   | messages[-1].tool_calls  | non-empty / empty                | auth_tools / END            | route_after_unauthenticated\nauth_tools        | authenticated            | True / False (denied)            | reading / unauthenticated   | route_after_auth\nreading           | messages[-1].tool_calls  | non-empty / empty                | inbox_tools / END           | route_after_reading\ninbox_tools       | inbox                    | non-empty / empty                | guard / END                 | route_after_fetch\nguard             | current_email, inbox     | set / None+items / None+empty    | drafting / guard / END      | route_after_guard\ndrafting          | -                        | always                           | awaiting_approval           | fixed edge\nawaiting_approval | human resume value       | approve / reject / edit,unknown  | sending / drafting / self   | Command(goto=...)\nsending           | inbox                    | non-empty / empty                | guard / END                 | route_after_send",
      "originalText": "from              | reads                    | condition                        | to                          | decided by\n------------------+--------------------------+----------------------------------+-----------------------------+----------------------------\nSTART             | authenticated            | False / True                     | unauthenticated / reading   | route_entry\nunauthenticated   | messages[-1].tool_calls  | non-empty / empty                | auth_tools / END            | route_after_unauthenticated\nauth_tools        | authenticated            | True / False (denied)            | reading / unauthenticated   | route_after_auth\nreading           | messages[-1].tool_calls  | non-empty / empty                | inbox_tools / END           | route_after_reading\ninbox_tools       | inbox                    | non-empty / empty                | guard / END                 | route_after_fetch\nguard             | current_email, inbox     | set / None+items / None+empty    | drafting / guard / END      | route_after_guard\ndrafting          | -                        | always                           | awaiting_approval           | fixed edge\nawaiting_approval | human resume value       | approve / reject / edit,unknown  | sending / drafting / self   | Command(goto=...)\nsending           | inbox                    | non-empty / empty                | guard / END                 | route_after_send",
