      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1900792739,
      "index": "b0Za22",
      "isDeleted": false,
      "seed": 1516612902,
      "text": "> Tools never run inside unauthenticated/reading -- those nodes only let the model DECIDE; ToolNodes execute.\n> Never route back to reading after the first fetch: fetch_inbox re-reads every .md file -> infinite loop.\n> guard's flagged branches must write current_email=None, else the router drafts a stale email twice.\n> HumanInTheLoopMiddleware is create_agent-only -> replaced by interrupt() inside auth_tool_access.\n> Checkpointer: MemorySaver (dev). interrupt() requires one; resume with Command(resume=...) on the same thread_id.",
      "originalText": "> Tools never run inside unauthenticated/reading -- those nodes only let the model DECIDE; ToolNodes execute.\n> Never route back to reading after the first fetch: fetch_inbox re-reads every .md file -> infinite loop.\n> guard's flagged branches must write current_email=None, else the router drafts a stale email twice.\n> HumanInTheLoopMiddleware is create_agent-only -> replaced by interrupt() inside auth_tool_access.\n> Checkpointer: MemorySaver (dev). interrupt() requires one; resume with Command(resume=...) on the same thread_id.",
      "fontSize": 16,
